    "lyrics": {
      "text": "When the thrones___ are____ set, and the books are__ o---pened, and God___ sit---teth for___ judg----ment, O what fear shall____ there be___ then! As the An-gels__ stand in__ fear, and the riv--er of__ fire___ flow--eth___ by, what then___ shall we__ do, we men who are guilt-y of__ man---y____ sins? And as we__ hear Him__ call__ the__ bless---ed of His Fa---ther__ in-to His___ King----dom, and send the sin----ners a--way to tor---ment, who will bear that____ dread ver---dict? But, O Sav----iour, Who a-lone____ art the__ Friend of man, O King____ of__ the___ ag-----es, be-fore the end, make___ haste__ and turn___ me____ back__ by re-pent--ance, and___ have mer---cy__ on___ me."
    }
  }
